1
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,380
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:11,330
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:16,060
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:21,220
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,210
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,460
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:33,730
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,690
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,690
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:45,060
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:48,050
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,900
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:54,250
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,420
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:00,500
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:03,380
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:06,820
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:19,260
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:22,340
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,460
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:28,420
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:33,060
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,690
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:57,750 --> 00:01:58,630
Enough.

25
00:01:57,990 --> 00:02:00,000
Gu Yundun
Sky Demon Country's Demon Emperor
Rank 3 000 000 Demonic Energy
(Illusory Yin)

26
00:02:03,550 --> 00:02:04,630
If you continue,

27
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:07,830
I'll throw you in the Dragon Pool to feed the Old Jiao.

28
00:02:11,750 --> 00:02:13,030
You're playing favorites !

29
00:02:12,790 --> 00:02:14,830
He's the one who bullied me first !

30
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:15,440
Demon Emperor Sword's
Sword Spirit

31
00:02:16,310 --> 00:02:18,710
You were about to level my entire Sky Demon City...

32
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:21,400
Moreover, he left the Hong Prison with his own skill.

33
00:02:21,150 --> 00:02:23,000
How does that count as bullying you ?

34
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,190
You...

35
00:02:26,230 --> 00:02:27,750
are too spoiled.

36
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:28,910
I don't care.

37
00:02:28,990 --> 00:02:29,990
This isn't over.

38
00:02:31,590 --> 00:02:32,960
Where are you going !?

39
00:02:32,830 --> 00:02:34,400
Let me out first !

40
00:02:39,950 --> 00:02:41,630
This Demon General Competition

41
00:02:42,230 --> 00:02:44,230
is getting more and more interesting...

42
00:02:49,790 --> 00:02:50,510
Look,

43
00:02:50,990 --> 00:02:52,350
your hair is all messy.

44
00:02:53,350 --> 00:02:54,150
Let's go.

45
00:02:54,790 --> 00:02:56,190
I want to go over there.

46
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:56,990
Let's go see the front.

47
00:02:56,830 --> 00:02:58,000
Let's go, let's go.

48
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:59,110
I'm sure you'll like it.

49
00:02:59,150 --> 00:02:59,750
Alright.

50
00:03:17,510 --> 00:03:18,630
Wan'er...

51
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:32,560
This sorrowful melody is bone-chilling...

52
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:34,110
How fitting...

53
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:37,670
Cultivators who defy the heavens

54
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:41,190
are destined to be forever lonely...

55
00:03:43,150 --> 00:03:44,830
Under the starlight and moonlight,

56
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:47,560
a solitary shadow sipping wine

57
00:03:48,230 --> 00:03:50,270
listens to the zither, savoring life.

58
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:54,320
I don't know how the cultivators who cultivated

59
00:03:54,070 --> 00:03:56,430
for tens of thousands of years endured this loneliness.

60
00:03:57,430 --> 00:03:58,750
But I know

61
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:02,720
that if one doesn't have at least a tiny bit of emotion,

62
00:04:02,950 --> 00:04:06,240
they are only cultivating their self-created Dao

63
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:08,600
and not the Dao of the heavens.

64
00:04:09,950 --> 00:04:11,390
Heaven and earth are inhumane.

65
00:04:11,830 --> 00:04:14,120
Cultivating is about defying the heavens,

66
00:04:13,950 --> 00:04:15,910
but if a cultivator is heartless,

67
00:04:16,550 --> 00:04:18,110
they are also inhumane.

68
00:04:19,590 --> 00:04:23,000
Using an inhumane heart to cultivate the heaven's inhumane Dao...

69
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:25,470
How can that be called defying the heavens ?

70
00:04:26,470 --> 00:04:28,190
What does "defying" even mean ?

71
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:32,600
That is merely following the will of the heavens.

72
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:47,200
Since ancient times, those who followed the will of the heavens

73
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,790
were favored by the heavens.

74
00:04:49,790 --> 00:04:52,990
But in reality they were merely insects.

75
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:56,070
The heavens can only be defied

76
00:04:56,230 --> 00:04:57,590
through emotions.

77
00:04:58,230 --> 00:05:00,120
Cultivating to defy the heavens

78
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:03,560
doesn't mean seeking to be immortal,

79
00:05:03,550 --> 00:05:06,110
but seeking to get rid of my status as an insect !

80
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:08,310
That is what it means to rebel !

81
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:11,920
Note: 逆 rebel / defy here is the same character used in the title Renegade Immortal.

82
00:05:12,550 --> 00:05:13,390
Wan'er...

83
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:16,190
We will meet again.

84
00:05:18,550 --> 00:05:20,430
This is my promise to you.

85
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:31,950
So he also is a heartbroken man...

86
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:42,670
Interesting...

87
00:05:50,950 --> 00:05:52,400
Have you found him ?

88
00:05:52,790 --> 00:05:54,320
I'm sorry for my incompetence...

89
00:05:54,670 --> 00:05:56,150
Where could he have gone ?

90
00:05:57,030 --> 00:05:57,990
It can't be...

91
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:04,320
Brother Wang !

92
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:05,790
Where have you been ?

93
00:06:06,550 --> 00:06:08,040
I just went out for a stroll

94
00:06:07,870 --> 00:06:09,120
to clear my mind.

95
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:11,040
Were you afraid I had left ?

96
00:06:13,270 --> 00:06:14,510
Of course not !

97
00:06:15,030 --> 00:06:16,950
I have important matters to discuss with you.

98
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:18,360
Attendant,

99
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:20,120
brew some tea for Brother Wang.

100
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,120
Right away.

101
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:26,350
Brother Wang, after your experience in the Hong Prison,

102
00:06:26,350 --> 00:06:28,150
what's your strength level ?

103
00:06:30,150 --> 00:06:31,680
Even without that palm strike,

104
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,070
I can defeat you.

105
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:36,710
Good.

106
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:37,790
Very good !

107
00:06:38,150 --> 00:06:39,590
My efforts were worth it

108
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:41,630
if you've improved that much !

109
00:06:42,350 --> 00:06:45,350
If you can truly help me win the Demon General Competition,

110
00:06:45,550 --> 00:06:48,190
I will personally recommend you to the Demon Emperor

111
00:06:48,470 --> 00:06:50,430
to secure a Demon General position for you.

112
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:56,550
There's one more thing.

113
00:06:57,430 --> 00:07:00,720
Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan has accumulated a lot of military merits over the years.

114
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:02,800
Now that Commander-in-Chief Xuan is dead,

115
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:05,710
he's sure to take that position.

116
00:07:06,350 --> 00:07:07,430
Most importantly,

117
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:10,030
he's favored by the Demon Emperor.

118
00:07:11,230 --> 00:07:14,150
If he can recommend us to the Demon Emperor,

119
00:07:14,550 --> 00:07:17,990
our road ahead will be way easier.

120
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:19,590
Tomorrow,

121
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:21,670
I want to take you to visit him.

122
00:07:22,110 --> 00:07:23,440
What do you think ?

123
00:07:24,350 --> 00:07:26,120
I'll follow Brother Mo's plan.

124
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:31,230
There are many visitors at the residence today.

125
00:07:29,710 --> 00:07:33,080
Xuan Residence
Sky Demon City

126
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:33,000
Master is already seeing someone.

127
00:07:33,310 --> 00:07:35,720
General Mo, please follow me to the side courtyard

128
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:37,040
and wait for a while.

129
00:07:38,150 --> 00:07:41,430
I wonder who Vice-Commander-in-chief Xuan is receiving.

130
00:07:45,110 --> 00:07:48,680
Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan
Rank 300 000 Demonic Energy
(Early stage Ascendant)

131
00:07:49,150 --> 00:07:51,310
You're not the first to come here.

132
00:07:52,350 --> 00:07:53,720
I'm aware

133
00:07:53,910 --> 00:07:55,200
of your request.

134
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:57,790
However,

135
00:07:58,230 --> 00:07:59,590
your mediocre gift

136
00:07:59,990 --> 00:08:01,230
doesn't impress me !

137
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:15,560
General Mo's Great Rotating Disk

138
00:08:15,670 --> 00:08:17,600
has already reached the 18th layer.

139
00:08:18,270 --> 00:08:19,270
Not bad.

140
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,320
If Vice Commander-in-chief favors me,

141
00:08:22,110 --> 00:08:23,200
once I'm appointed,

142
00:08:23,030 --> 00:08:24,910
I'll do everything I can to help you.

143
00:08:25,790 --> 00:08:27,830
We are all soldiers of the Sky Demon Country.

144
00:08:28,270 --> 00:08:29,950
Our loyalty is to His Majesty.

145
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,750
However,

146
00:08:34,230 --> 00:08:35,790
I will remember

147
00:08:36,350 --> 00:08:37,470
what you said.

148
00:08:38,830 --> 00:08:40,360
Thank you, Vice Commander-in-chief !

149
00:09:01,470 --> 00:09:02,550
This aura...

150
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:05,110
feels familiar.

151
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:08,390
That was Mo Fei.

152
00:09:09,630 --> 00:09:11,750
He was faster than us.

153
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:19,920
I pay respects to V...

154
00:09:29,070 --> 00:09:31,000
You're not kneeling before me ?

155
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:32,710
You have some guts.

156
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:36,390
However, in this competition,

157
00:09:37,030 --> 00:09:39,360
you have at most 40% chance of winning.

158
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:41,430
Adding this person,

159
00:09:41,950 --> 00:09:43,280
I'm 90% confident !

160
00:09:45,550 --> 00:09:46,990
Use your full strength.

161
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,710
Let me see what you're worth.

162
00:10:06,950 --> 00:10:08,280
Forgive me.

163
00:10:13,070 --> 00:10:14,070
What's your name ?

164
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,110
Wang Lin.

165
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:19,360
General Mo has gained a fine subordinate.

166
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:20,870
It's hard to predict

167
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:23,270
who will win the competition now...

168
00:10:24,550 --> 00:10:26,600
We hope for Vice-Commander-in-chief's favor.

169
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:29,470
I, Mo Lihai, vow to repay you in the future.

170
00:10:30,950 --> 00:10:32,110
In this competition,

171
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:33,720
you'll have to rely on your own strength.

172
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:34,510
You both...

173
00:10:35,070 --> 00:10:36,190
are dismissed.

174
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:37,950
Understood.

175
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:49,190
This guy's strength is unfathomable...

176
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:52,160
This is an order:

177
00:10:52,350 --> 00:10:53,470
from now on,

178
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:55,560
the residence is closed !

179
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:00,430
Demon General...

180
00:11:04,150 --> 00:11:05,870
Rely on their own strength ?

181
00:11:21,230 --> 00:11:22,150
Brother Wang,

182
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:24,070
I must tell you something.

183
00:11:24,710 --> 00:11:27,870
There is a lot of scheming before the Demon General Competition.

184
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:31,320
Demon Generals are protected by imperial decree

185
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:32,470
but their helpers

186
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:34,390
often die mysteriously.

187
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:36,670
Mo Fei ?

188
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,470
The details of what happened today

189
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:44,470
have probably already reached his ears.

190
00:11:45,070 --> 00:11:46,030
This man

191
00:11:46,430 --> 00:11:48,720
is no stranger to stabbing in the back.

192
00:11:49,190 --> 00:11:50,440
Before the competition,

193
00:11:50,190 --> 00:11:51,710
I need to cultivate in seclusion.

194
00:11:52,590 --> 00:11:54,760
You must be careful, Brother Wang.

195
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:56,760
Don't worry.

196
00:12:12,470 --> 00:12:13,670
A spy reported that

197
00:12:13,990 --> 00:12:15,280
Mo Lihai is in seclusion

198
00:12:15,070 --> 00:12:16,720
and this man is alone outside.

199
00:12:17,350 --> 00:12:19,510
That saves us the trouble of looking for him.

200
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:22,790
He didn't even set up a defensive restriction ?

201
00:12:23,150 --> 00:12:24,590
He's not afraid of death at all.

202
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:26,590
Maybe...

203
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:29,310
he thinks no one will dare to attack him ?

204
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:31,200
Proceed as planned.

205
00:12:31,350 --> 00:12:32,750
Since Master has requested it,

206
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:34,190
we must ensure

207
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:35,680
that he dies !

208
00:12:57,710 --> 00:12:58,590
Ink-Tip Spear,

209
00:12:58,510 --> 00:12:59,190
attack !

210
00:12:59,950 --> 00:13:00,950
Primordial Heaven Seal,

211
00:13:01,110 --> 00:13:01,830
fall !

212
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:06,870
His finger spell is powerful

213
00:13:07,350 --> 00:13:09,440
but with the Primordial Heaven Seal suppressing him

214
00:13:09,350 --> 00:13:10,920
and with the Ink-Tip Spear,

215
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:12,030
there's no way he can survive.

216
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:29,630
What the hell is this spell !?

217
00:13:39,830 --> 00:13:41,790
How many people has this person killed ?!

218
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:45,550
Could he be cultivating the legendary Dao of slaughter ?

219
00:13:46,110 --> 00:13:47,790
Since you've come here,

220
00:13:47,550 --> 00:13:49,710
why are you already leaving ?

221
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:07,520
The competition hasn't even started

222
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:08,990
but blood has already been spilled.

223
00:14:10,070 --> 00:14:11,190
Interesting...

224
00:14:13,150 --> 00:14:14,550
The assassination failed

225
00:14:15,470 --> 00:14:17,870
but this is far from over.

226
00:14:22,790 --> 00:14:26,200
Main Hall
Sky Demon City

227
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:26,590
So your fighting spirit is high

228
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:30,270
and you wish to have a preemptive duel with Mo Lihai ?

229
00:14:31,070 --> 00:14:32,470
This isn't a bad idea.

230
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:34,630
Granted.

231
00:14:35,150 --> 00:14:36,630
Thank you, Your Majesty !

232
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:40,350
Your Majesty,

233
00:14:40,390 --> 00:14:42,670
the Demon General Competition is an ancestral tradition.

234
00:14:42,590 --> 00:14:45,790
If we allow these two to set a precedent for private duels,

235
00:14:45,950 --> 00:14:47,910
I'm afraid in the future...

236
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:53,880
If in the future, someone can be like Mo Fei and earn millions of military merits

237
00:14:53,750 --> 00:14:56,000
by killing in the Fire Demon Country.

238
00:14:56,350 --> 00:14:57,190
Then I...

239
00:14:57,710 --> 00:14:59,390
will grant it to them as well.

240
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:10,710
His Majesty has allowed my private duel with Mo Lihai.

241
00:15:11,390 --> 00:15:12,590
You will deliver

242
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:13,830
this challenge letter.

243
00:15:16,550 --> 00:15:17,880
The Demon General Competition

244
00:15:17,630 --> 00:15:19,230
is none of my business.

245
00:15:20,190 --> 00:15:22,270
But this Seventh Purple Disciple...

246
00:15:29,350 --> 00:15:30,600
Stop right there !

247
00:15:40,230 --> 00:15:42,910
This person's cultivation is not beneath mine.

248
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:45,910
His sword intent is astonishing.

249
00:15:49,590 --> 00:15:51,030
General Mo Fei

250
00:15:51,350 --> 00:15:53,190
challenges you to a duel

251
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:54,910
3 days from now

252
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:56,590
at the Ancient Pavilion.

253
00:15:56,950 --> 00:15:57,950
We hope

254
00:15:58,190 --> 00:15:59,590
that General Mo

255
00:15:59,870 --> 00:16:01,400
will not avoid this duel.

256
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:02,840
He's here !

257
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:06,030
I heard the All-Seer is quite proud of this disciple.

258
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:07,830
If I kill him,

259
00:16:07,590 --> 00:16:08,990
I'll be heavily rewarded.

260
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:12,630
Seventh Purple Disciple,

261
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:15,550
would you like to spar with me ?

262
00:16:28,350 --> 00:16:30,910
How could my Da Lou Sword Qi shatter upon impact ?!

263
00:16:31,350 --> 00:16:33,430
What kind of spell did he cultivate ?!

264
00:16:57,950 --> 00:16:59,710
Wei Yang Sword Slash !

265
00:17:07,150 --> 00:17:09,080
What a waste of a good sword.

266
00:17:14,630 --> 00:17:15,830
Damn Beast !

267
00:17:27,350 --> 00:17:28,280
You...

268
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:30,190
I have no grudge with the Da Lou Sword Sect.

269
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:33,200
Sect rivalries are for our elders to decide.

270
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:35,280
We don't have to be enemies

271
00:17:35,430 --> 00:17:36,950
within the Demon Spirit Land.

272
00:17:50,470 --> 00:17:52,070
This man is no joke,

273
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:53,710
letting him go is unwise !

274
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:02,470
He broke my sword intent

275
00:18:02,230 --> 00:18:03,600
and my sword slash...

276
00:18:03,950 --> 00:18:05,590
He's stronger than me...

277
00:18:06,070 --> 00:18:09,230
He will definitely become a serious threat to our Da Lou Sword Sect !

278
00:18:09,430 --> 00:18:10,310
This man...

279
00:18:10,670 --> 00:18:11,750
must die !

280
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:21,030
I use my Soul Blood to awaken Master's Sword Qi !

281
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:35,590
Slash !

282
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,830
Wang... Lin...

283
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:03,230
Ling Tianhou's Sword Qi is very powerful.

284
00:19:04,230 --> 00:19:07,230
If he had succeeded in using this Sword Qi,

285
00:19:07,750 --> 00:19:09,630
even with my Life Seals,

286
00:19:10,230 --> 00:19:11,790
I would've died for sure.

287
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:16,400
A cornered beast is hard to fight,

288
00:19:16,150 --> 00:19:17,960
always give the enemy a way out.

289
00:19:17,750 --> 00:19:19,990
Brother Wang, what excellent scheming !

290
00:19:31,390 --> 00:19:34,230
So this is the life-saving Sword Qi

291
00:19:35,150 --> 00:19:38,590
that Ling Tianhou gave to his 12 disciples before they entered.

292
00:19:45,670 --> 00:19:47,310
It seems to obtain the Sword Qi,

293
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:49,830
I must first refine the Origin Soul.

294
00:19:58,750 --> 00:20:00,840
3 days later

295
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:55,840
This Sword Qi's power is earth-shattering.

296
00:20:56,150 --> 00:20:58,670
Wei Yang really gave me a great gift.

297
00:21:05,750 --> 00:21:07,120
He's badly injured.

298
00:21:07,750 --> 00:21:09,960
Mo Fei's Great Rotating Disk

299
00:21:09,950 --> 00:21:13,160
even broke the Hundred Waves Demon Sea that His Majesty taught me.

300
00:21:15,230 --> 00:21:16,360
I lost...

301
00:21:17,950 --> 00:21:20,000
I made an agreement with Mo Fei before the duel.

302
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:21,560
The loser will not participate.

303
00:21:21,670 --> 00:21:22,870
Now,

304
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:26,280
whether I can obtain the Vice Commander-in-chief position

305
00:21:26,230 --> 00:21:27,790
entirely depends on Brother Wang !

306
00:21:28,870 --> 00:21:30,200
I will accomplish

307
00:21:30,470 --> 00:21:32,080
what I promised you.

308
00:21:42,670 --> 00:21:48,560
I've been walking this path for endless years

309
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:48,560
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

310
00:21:48,950 --> 00:21:54,160
Is it the compass of fate

311
00:21:50,790 --> 00:21:54,160
that wrote this outcome for us ?

312
00:21:54,070 --> 00:22:00,080
The heavens want to erase your existence,

313
00:21:59,950 --> 00:22:05,800
that's the obsession guiding me.

314
00:22:05,830 --> 00:22:11,400
Is this the path to uncover

315
00:22:07,710 --> 00:22:11,400
truths from falsehoods ?

316
00:22:11,430 --> 00:22:17,000
In a world of murk and shadow,

317
00:22:13,330 --> 00:22:17,000
only the flame of truth can light the way.

318
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:22,720
Look at them all,

319
00:22:19,670 --> 00:22:22,720
being carried by the waves.

320
00:22:22,910 --> 00:22:27,360
Look at them all,

321
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:27,360
being drowned.

322
00:22:27,190 --> 00:22:30,680
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

323
00:22:30,470 --> 00:22:33,760
I will let the world refine my soul.

324
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:39,320
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

325
00:22:35,330 --> 00:22:39,320
I will fight.

326
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:42,440
I'll break through the abyss of despair

327
00:22:42,190 --> 00:22:45,480
to finally learn who I really am.

328
00:22:45,230 --> 00:22:50,840
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

329
00:22:47,110 --> 00:22:50,840
I embrace this obsession.

330
00:22:50,590 --> 00:22:53,800
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

331
00:22:53,550 --> 00:22:56,600
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

332
00:22:56,350 --> 00:23:02,080
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

333
00:22:58,390 --> 00:23:02,080
I'll still fight.

334
00:23:02,030 --> 00:23:05,440
It's hard to avoid loneliness

335
00:23:05,190 --> 00:23:08,480
when you are above everyone else.

336
00:23:08,230 --> 00:23:14,160
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

337
00:23:10,550 --> 00:23:14,160
be afraid of a firefly ?
